# .vercelignore — keep internal evidence and audit leftovers out of every
# Vercel build/upload. These files are already 404 on the live site (Astro
# only serves public/ and src/pages/), so this is defense-in-depth: shrinks
# the deploy footprint, eliminates any possibility of a future build-config
# change accidentally exposing them, and cuts upload/build time.
#
# WHAT NOT TO ADD HERE:
# - src/**            → source code the build actually needs
# - public/**         → static assets that must be served
# - data/**           → some source files are consumed by the build
# - package*.json     → build needs deps
# - astro.config.*, tsconfig.json, vercel.json → config the platform reads
# - .well-known/**    → if we ever add verification files
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal evidence / audit reports — never public
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/PROJECT_TRACKER.md
/reports/
/docs/internal/
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quarantined content — unreviewed drafts + generated images.
# .content-quarantine/generated/ is the review staging area for new pages
# BEFORE they get promoted to src/pages/. Neither Astro nor Vercel should
# ever see this directory during a production build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.content-quarantine/
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build and validation scripts
#
# Do not ignore scripts/. package.json invokes files from this directory
# during validation and deployment, so Vercel must receive it.
# Exclude only generated Python cache artifacts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/scripts/**/__pycache__/
/scripts/**/*.pyc
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secret / key material — the IndexNow key file
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.indexnow-key
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local backup snapshots + editor droppings
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/backups/
*.backup.ts
*.backup.md
.DS_Store
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sitemap-export snapshots I generated for handoff
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/sitemap-export/
